WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.620
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.890 --> 01:43.060
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.110 --> 01:43.600
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.600 --> 01:45.840
[Episode 25]

5
01:46.710 --> 01:47.920
Take him back to the county jail

6
01:47.920 --> 01:48.950
and deal with him according to the law.

7
01:48.950 --> 01:49.759
-Yes. -Yes.

8
01:51.280 --> 01:52.070
Move!

9
02:20.150 --> 02:21.190
Could he be...

10
02:23.420 --> 02:24.230
Child,

11
02:24.520 --> 02:25.800
these are the kind people

12
02:25.800 --> 02:26.960
who sought justice for your parents.

13
02:26.960 --> 02:28.560
Quick, kowtow to them.

14
02:31.150 --> 02:32.710
Thank you, officers,

15
02:32.750 --> 02:34.810
for bringing justice for my parents.

16
02:38.390 --> 02:39.460
Alright, child.

17
02:40.579 --> 02:41.730
Get up.

18
02:57.430 --> 02:58.630
This child was lucky.

19
02:58.910 --> 03:00.190
Back then, when I came forward

20
03:00.190 --> 03:01.000
to claim the bodies

21
03:01.000 --> 03:02.200
of him and his mother,

22
03:02.800 --> 03:04.120
I was astonished to find

23
03:04.120 --> 03:05.590
there was still a breath of life

24
03:05.590 --> 03:07.000
left in his tiny body.

25
03:07.590 --> 03:08.800
Perhaps it was all

26
03:09.240 --> 03:10.750
predestined by Heaven.

27
03:12.120 --> 03:14.780
He has no interest in cuju or riding and archery—

28
03:15.150 --> 03:17.680
he only likes tinkering with shadow puppets.

29
03:25.000 --> 03:26.750
The art of shadow puppetry in Gutan

30
03:26.750 --> 03:28.210
has someone to carry it on.

31
03:43.520 --> 03:44.310
Go.

32
03:45.750 --> 03:46.560
Everyone,

33
03:47.400 --> 03:48.590
what do you think?

34
03:50.000 --> 03:51.800
We've investigated everything

35
03:52.120 --> 03:53.520
and managed to clear up

36
03:53.520 --> 03:55.120
the old case from 6 years ago,

37
03:55.840 --> 03:57.120
but it's of no help

38
03:57.710 --> 03:59.560
to the case at hand.

39
04:00.560 --> 04:02.590
According to Du Zhongtao's statement,

40
04:02.590 --> 04:03.840
Sui Bing must've died

41
04:03.840 --> 04:06.590
before the shadow puppets ran amok during the lunar eclipse.

42
04:06.590 --> 04:08.050
Deputy General Ji Xun said

43
04:08.110 --> 04:09.630
the eclipse began

44
04:09.630 --> 04:11.240
an hour after Sui Bing left,

45
04:11.430 --> 04:12.960
so he must have been murdered

46
04:12.960 --> 04:13.960
within that hour.

47
04:14.800 --> 04:15.700
If we can find out

48
04:15.700 --> 04:16.500
where he went,

49
04:16.529 --> 04:17.279
what he did,

50
04:17.310 --> 04:18.310
and whom he met

51
04:18.360 --> 04:19.390
during that hour,

52
04:19.600 --> 04:20.430
the mystery

53
04:20.600 --> 04:22.000
should unravel.

54
04:22.430 --> 04:23.390
I remember

55
04:23.600 --> 04:24.720
that last night,

56
04:25.010 --> 04:26.390
Sui Bing was the only one on duty

57
04:26.390 --> 04:28.040
who could move about freely.

58
04:28.430 --> 04:30.280
He could indeed have gone up to the Yunding Pavilion

59
04:30.280 --> 04:31.940
without arousing suspicion.

60
04:32.240 --> 04:34.040
Perhaps he did something,

61
04:34.680 --> 04:35.480
or perhaps...

62
04:37.120 --> 04:38.000
He discovered

63
04:38.000 --> 04:40.860
a secret that could never be revealed to outsiders.

64
04:41.720 --> 04:42.980
And so he was silenced?

65
04:43.680 --> 04:44.480
Exactly.

66
04:45.800 --> 04:46.600
Looks like

67
04:46.800 --> 04:48.600
we must go to the Yunding Pavilion.

68
04:48.600 --> 04:49.430
Wait.

69
04:51.560 --> 04:52.490
I'll go with you.

70
04:53.480 --> 04:54.270
We'd better

71
04:54.390 --> 04:56.040
investigate this discreetly.

72
04:56.040 --> 04:57.190
The more of us go,

73
04:57.430 --> 04:59.430
the more likely we are to be exposed.

74
05:00.190 --> 05:01.190
Then we'll go back to the county office first

75
05:01.190 --> 05:02.790
and examine Sui Bing's body.

76
05:03.070 --> 05:03.870
Alright.

77
05:03.920 --> 05:04.720
Qingyang,

78
05:05.430 --> 05:06.430
be very careful.

79
05:08.240 --> 05:09.040
Don't worry.

80
05:26.730 --> 05:28.190
The side window is tucked away.

81
05:28.190 --> 05:29.430
If I were Sui Bing,

82
05:29.560 --> 05:30.310
I'd definitely choose

83
05:30.310 --> 05:31.720
this spot to spy from.

84
05:41.310 --> 05:42.170
Third Brother?

85
05:57.240 --> 05:58.040
Are you okay?

86
05:58.430 --> 05:59.159
I'm fine.

87
05:59.159 --> 06:00.420
The blessing ceremony

88
06:00.430 --> 06:02.000
concerns the fate of the nation.

89
06:02.000 --> 06:03.720
It's my duty,

90
06:03.800 --> 06:05.260
and I dare not be careless.

91
06:05.390 --> 06:06.630
Your Highness,

92
06:07.430 --> 06:08.960
please forgive my offense.

93
06:09.630 --> 06:10.430
Who's there?

94
06:10.480 --> 06:11.270
Hurry!

95
06:13.720 --> 06:14.820
Greetings, Your Highness.

96
06:14.820 --> 06:15.540
May I ask

97
06:15.570 --> 06:17.160
what happened just now, Your Highness?

98
06:17.160 --> 06:18.190
Commander,

99
06:19.830 --> 06:23.640
[Divine Constable Tally]

100
06:20.830 --> 06:22.190
I am Divine Constable Li Qingyang

101
06:22.190 --> 06:24.000
of the Divine Constable Bureau.

102
06:24.190 --> 06:25.040
Just now,

103
06:25.360 --> 06:27.160
I came here to investigate,

104
06:27.430 --> 06:29.890
and His Highness mistook me for an assassin.

105
06:31.040 --> 06:32.770
It was all a misunderstanding.

106
06:35.430 --> 06:36.630
Divine Constable Li,

107
06:37.040 --> 06:38.830
the Yunding Pavilion is a forbidden area.

108
06:38.830 --> 06:39.750
Even I

109
06:39.920 --> 06:41.240
cannot enter at will.

110
06:41.240 --> 06:42.000
Still,

111
06:42.240 --> 06:44.440
thankfully it was a misunderstanding.

112
06:44.630 --> 06:46.830
We, too, have failed in our duty to guard this place.

113
06:46.830 --> 06:49.159
Fortunately, Your Highness intervened.

114
06:49.560 --> 06:50.600
Then step aside.

115
06:50.870 --> 06:51.680
Yes.

116
06:52.630 --> 06:53.430
Let's go.

117
07:01.830 --> 07:02.750
Are you okay?

118
07:03.430 --> 07:04.920
Thank you for your concern, Your Highness.

119
07:04.920 --> 07:05.720
I'm fine.

120
07:06.240 --> 07:07.950
Thank you for saving me just now.

121
07:07.950 --> 07:09.510
Who was that old man?

122
07:10.310 --> 07:11.750
Master Yun Hai,

123
07:11.920 --> 07:14.180
the abbot of the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

124
07:14.430 --> 07:16.120
Isn't he supposed to be in seclusion?

125
07:16.120 --> 07:18.000
His seclusion is just a cover.

126
07:18.430 --> 07:19.190
I've

127
07:19.630 --> 07:21.120
fought him before.

128
07:21.390 --> 07:22.720
His martial arts skills

129
07:22.720 --> 07:23.830
are unfathomable.

130
07:25.510 --> 07:30.040
-You snuck into the pavilion tonight... -You snuck into the pavilion tonight...

131
07:33.430 --> 07:34.240
It seems the two of us

132
07:34.240 --> 07:36.500
are thinking along the same lines again.

133
07:38.510 --> 07:40.600
Did Your Highness find anything?

134
07:41.159 --> 07:42.360
I saw Ye.

135
07:42.830 --> 07:44.430
The rite of beseeching heaven requires

136
07:44.430 --> 07:46.159
kneeling for 24 hours.

137
07:46.190 --> 07:48.630
Yet, despite his young age, he's still holding on.

138
07:48.630 --> 07:50.690
He's very filial to his grandfather.

139
07:51.000 --> 07:52.120
He's a good child.

140
07:52.360 --> 07:53.159
Indeed,

141
07:53.800 --> 07:54.950
a good child.

142
07:55.920 --> 07:58.520
All the old palace attendants who have seen him

143
07:58.790 --> 08:00.210
say in private

144
08:00.800 --> 08:01.930
that his appearance

145
08:02.600 --> 08:04.000
somewhat resembles Yan.

146
08:45.440 --> 08:46.300
Your Highness.

147
08:48.630 --> 08:49.630
What are you doing?

148
08:49.630 --> 08:51.750
Today would've been my late fourth brother's birthday.

149
08:51.750 --> 08:53.010
Every year on this day,

150
08:53.200 --> 08:54.870
I weave him

151
08:56.030 --> 08:57.030
a katydid cage.

152
09:07.510 --> 09:08.510
Third Brother!

153
09:10.030 --> 09:11.160
Third Brother!

154
09:12.510 --> 09:15.370
-Third Brother. -Your Highness the Fourth Prince.

155
09:15.840 --> 09:17.100
Shouldn't you be studying

156
09:17.100 --> 09:18.240
instead of running around?

157
09:18.240 --> 09:19.630
Be careful. If Father sees you,

158
09:19.630 --> 09:20.890
he'll scold you again.

159
09:21.600 --> 09:24.120
Father would never have the heart to scold me.

160
09:24.120 --> 09:25.500
Look what I've got.

161
09:26.000 --> 09:27.550
Father wove this for me.

162
09:27.550 --> 09:28.440
Is it pretty?

163
09:38.670 --> 09:39.480
It is.

164
09:42.720 --> 09:43.510
Here.

165
09:44.790 --> 09:45.960
Later, I'll ask Father

166
09:45.960 --> 09:47.510
to weave one for you too.

167
09:48.600 --> 09:49.390
Yan.

168
09:49.890 --> 09:50.850
Would you like

169
09:50.880 --> 09:52.630
a little house for your katydid?

170
09:52.630 --> 09:53.690
I know how to weave.

171
09:53.720 --> 09:55.250
I'll make one for you, okay?

172
09:55.480 --> 09:56.270
Really?

173
09:57.630 --> 10:00.080
Third Brother, you're amazing!

174
10:01.840 --> 10:04.310
My katydid's going to have a house!

175
10:04.440 --> 10:07.090
My katydid's going to have a house!

176
10:07.390 --> 10:08.270
That's great!

177
10:08.300 --> 10:10.300
My katydid's going to have a house!

178
10:11.320 --> 10:12.120
So,

179
10:12.840 --> 10:14.770
you've remembered that all along.

180
10:26.440 --> 10:27.300
Your Highness,

181
10:27.840 --> 10:28.840
is there...

182
10:29.440 --> 10:31.360
something on my face?

183
10:36.720 --> 10:38.360
I just think you

184
10:38.600 --> 10:39.840
remind me very much

185
10:40.120 --> 10:41.390
of someone I once knew.

186
10:58.910 --> 10:59.770
Doesn't match.

187
11:12.640 --> 11:14.700
Magistrate Du, what brings you here?

188
11:15.030 --> 11:15.840
My Lady,

189
11:17.200 --> 11:19.440
I noticed you've been working

190
11:19.790 --> 11:20.910
on the case late into the night.

191
11:20.910 --> 11:22.000
You must be very tired.

192
11:22.000 --> 11:23.660
So I thought I'd come by and ask

193
11:23.940 --> 11:25.640
if you'd like some tea and refreshments.

194
11:25.640 --> 11:26.400
No need.

195
11:27.600 --> 11:29.360
Forgive my poor timing.

196
11:37.240 --> 11:38.630
Have you found anything

197
11:38.720 --> 11:41.320
about General Sui's death, Divine Constable?

198
11:41.550 --> 11:42.360
Not yet.

199
11:46.440 --> 11:48.510
Not even a single lead?

200
11:48.510 --> 11:49.390
Magistrate Du,

201
11:51.240 --> 11:52.560
could it be

202
11:53.720 --> 11:55.360
that you have a clever idea

203
11:55.390 --> 11:57.840
to guide us

204
11:57.910 --> 11:59.120
out of our confusion?

205
12:00.330 --> 12:02.210
I'm hardly capable of that.

206
12:02.240 --> 12:03.000
Get out.

207
12:13.320 --> 12:14.450
Where are you going?

208
12:14.630 --> 12:16.560
I'm still a bit worried about Li Si.

209
12:16.600 --> 12:17.730
I'll go check on him.

210
12:21.840 --> 12:22.750
Look at him.

211
12:23.200 --> 12:24.550
Our Little Ice Cube

212
12:24.790 --> 12:25.750
is

213
12:26.120 --> 12:27.440
melting.

214
12:31.360 --> 12:32.150
Zhenzhu,

215
12:32.600 --> 12:33.790
take a look at this.

216
12:34.790 --> 12:36.650
Found under Sui Bing's boot sole.

217
12:43.150 --> 12:44.000
It's moss.

218
12:44.270 --> 12:45.110
Moss?

219
12:46.840 --> 12:48.000
Blue moss?

220
12:49.000 --> 12:50.560
Send a message back to the Bureau

221
12:50.560 --> 12:51.190
to ask if there are

222
12:51.190 --> 12:52.590
any records of blue moss.

223
12:57.260 --> 12:59.450
[Great Virtue Bears All Things]

224
13:26.150 --> 13:27.000
Sui Bing...

225
13:33.550 --> 13:34.880
Dragon Saliva Crystal?

226
13:35.550 --> 13:36.480
Sui Bing,

227
13:36.840 --> 13:38.360
you won't be needing it anyway.

228
13:38.360 --> 13:39.760
I'll keep it safe for you.

229
13:45.750 --> 13:46.600
It's mine.

230
13:47.150 --> 13:48.200
It's mine.

231
14:32.000 --> 14:33.910
Your Highness's heartfelt gesture

232
14:33.910 --> 14:35.970
will surely reach the Fourth Prince.

233
14:52.630 --> 14:54.630
Tomorrow is the blessing ceremony,

234
14:55.550 --> 14:57.200
yet we still haven't made any progress

235
14:57.200 --> 14:58.910
on the case of the shadow puppet ghost.

236
14:58.910 --> 15:01.710
Now, we also have Sui Bing's death to contend with.

237
15:02.510 --> 15:03.710
What do you plan to do?

238
15:03.910 --> 15:04.720
Actually,

239
15:05.840 --> 15:07.750
before I came to Gutan this time,

240
15:08.200 --> 15:10.840
Chief Xuanyuan already suspected

241
15:11.120 --> 15:12.750
that Liluo was behind all this.

242
15:12.750 --> 15:13.550
Sure enough.

243
15:14.320 --> 15:15.840
How could those bandits miss

244
15:15.840 --> 15:18.030
such an important opportunity?

245
15:19.010 --> 15:20.350
How despicable.

246
15:22.750 --> 15:24.000
Please rest assured, Your Highness.

247
15:24.000 --> 15:26.630
I will spare no effort

248
15:27.000 --> 15:29.400
to root out the Liluo remnants completely.

249
15:29.910 --> 15:31.840
Since Liluo has come prepared this time,

250
15:31.840 --> 15:33.360
we must keep a strict watch.

251
15:33.360 --> 15:34.320
I'll go back now.

252
15:39.000 --> 15:40.200
Divine Constable Li,

253
15:40.850 --> 15:42.600
you're an outstanding investigator.

254
15:42.600 --> 15:45.240
Having a capable official like you is a blessing

255
15:45.240 --> 15:46.770
for the people of Great Shi.

256
15:58.030 --> 15:58.890
Third Brother,

257
16:00.630 --> 16:02.750
having a prince like you...

258
16:04.630 --> 16:06.290
is the true blessing for them.

259
16:31.820 --> 16:33.830
I've run out of the Demon-Suppressing Pills.

260
16:33.830 --> 16:35.440
What am I to do from now on?

261
16:53.200 --> 16:54.200
It's blood.

262
16:54.930 --> 16:56.760
Why is there blood here?

263
16:57.440 --> 16:59.700
And dripped right on top of lotus leaves.

264
17:00.960 --> 17:02.790
It flew right over my head!

265
17:03.630 --> 17:05.829
Blood was raining down from the sky!

266
17:16.510 --> 17:17.310
Are you okay?

267
17:23.990 --> 17:24.780
Meng Rui,

268
17:25.790 --> 17:26.650
I know the truth

269
17:26.660 --> 17:27.990
about how Sui Bing died.

270
17:28.720 --> 17:29.510
Let's go.

271
17:30.110 --> 17:32.710
Come with me to the Department of Food Affairs.

272
17:35.030 --> 17:36.440
This lowly servant deserves to die!

273
17:36.440 --> 17:37.700
I was blind and foolish

274
17:37.830 --> 17:39.640
not to recognize you, Divine Constable.

275
17:39.640 --> 17:40.440
I just...

276
17:40.920 --> 17:42.830
lost my head over the money.

277
17:43.070 --> 17:43.790
Otherwise,

278
17:43.790 --> 17:45.200
even if I'd had 10 lives,

279
17:45.200 --> 17:45.900
I wouldn't have dared

280
17:45.900 --> 17:47.550
to take your money, Divine Constable!

281
17:47.550 --> 17:49.200
Please show mercy, Divine Constable!

282
17:49.200 --> 17:50.960
Xiaoshan, there's no need for this.

283
17:50.960 --> 17:52.030
Get up first.

284
17:59.400 --> 18:00.640
I've already given you the money.

285
18:00.640 --> 18:02.000
Just keep it.

286
18:02.790 --> 18:03.840
However,

287
18:04.000 --> 18:06.120
you must answer my questions

288
18:06.440 --> 18:07.920
truthfully.

289
18:08.160 --> 18:08.960
Yes.

290
18:09.720 --> 18:11.000
Please ask, Divine Constable.

291
18:11.000 --> 18:12.550
If I utter a single lie,

292
18:12.590 --> 18:13.880
may Heaven strike me down!

293
18:13.880 --> 18:14.680
Last night,

294
18:14.750 --> 18:16.160
when the shadow puppets caused trouble,

295
18:16.160 --> 18:17.790
what exactly did you see?

296
18:19.030 --> 18:19.830
Last night,

297
18:20.110 --> 18:21.550
after delivering the food,

298
18:21.550 --> 18:23.160
I was passing by the Langyue Studio

299
18:23.160 --> 18:24.960
when the sky suddenly darkened.

300
18:28.590 --> 18:30.390
That shadow flew by really fast.

301
18:30.640 --> 18:31.900
At that time, I thought

302
18:32.030 --> 18:33.830
I'd run into Yin Jie's ghost.

303
18:33.890 --> 18:37.520
[Langyue Studio]

304
18:34.680 --> 18:35.480
So,

305
18:35.920 --> 18:37.310
I plucked up my courage

306
18:37.670 --> 18:39.000
and tried to sneak into the Langyue Studio

307
18:39.000 --> 18:40.310
to see what was going on.

308
18:40.310 --> 18:41.710
When I climbed upstairs,

309
18:41.830 --> 18:42.750
I saw

310
18:43.000 --> 18:45.000
General Sui lying dead on the terrace,

311
18:45.000 --> 18:46.170
covered in blood.

312
18:46.310 --> 18:47.240
So much blood!

313
18:47.720 --> 18:48.830
I swear to Heaven,

314
18:49.160 --> 18:50.170
I had absolutely nothing

315
18:50.170 --> 18:51.370
to do with it!

316
18:51.400 --> 18:53.440
It... It was Yin Jie's vengeful spirit.

317
18:53.440 --> 18:54.270
I saw it with my own eyes!

318
18:54.270 --> 18:56.330
The spirit flew right across the sky!

319
18:56.510 --> 18:58.110
The one flying across the sky

320
18:58.720 --> 19:00.650
wasn't Yin Jie's vengeful spirit,

321
19:00.920 --> 19:02.110
but Sui Bing.

322
19:03.030 --> 19:03.830
Sui Bing?

323
19:05.110 --> 19:05.960
Xiaoshan,

324
19:06.200 --> 19:07.600
go back and get some rest.

325
19:08.510 --> 19:09.310
Yes.

326
19:13.240 --> 19:14.000
Meng Rui,

327
19:14.920 --> 19:16.590
I found something

328
19:16.640 --> 19:18.570
on the lotus leaves at Tinghe Pond.

329
19:21.550 --> 19:23.440
Of the 4 main buildings at the Golden Dragon Pavilion,

330
19:23.440 --> 19:25.310
the principal one, the Tongtian Pavilion,

331
19:25.310 --> 19:26.240
stands 6 stories tall,

332
19:26.240 --> 19:27.310
about 18 chi high.

333
19:27.590 --> 19:28.720
This creates

334
19:28.720 --> 19:30.960
a height difference between the Tongtian Pavilion

335
19:30.960 --> 19:32.590
and the other 3.

336
19:32.830 --> 19:34.590
After killing Sui Bing,

337
19:34.750 --> 19:36.960
the murderer took advantage of this height difference

338
19:36.960 --> 19:39.440
to move the body from the Tongtian Pavilion

339
19:39.830 --> 19:41.350
to the Langyue Studio.

340
19:41.830 --> 19:43.920
This ingenious move not only concealed

341
19:43.920 --> 19:45.180
the traces of the crime

342
19:45.240 --> 19:46.240
but also neatly

343
19:46.240 --> 19:47.590
shifted suspicion

344
19:47.590 --> 19:49.070
onto the shadow puppets

345
19:49.070 --> 19:50.310
that had run amok that night.

346
19:50.310 --> 19:51.350
This explains

347
19:51.350 --> 19:52.310
why Sui Bing's body

348
19:52.310 --> 19:54.030
was not strung up like the others.

349
19:54.030 --> 19:54.960
Moreover, the Tongtian Pavilion

350
19:54.960 --> 19:55.920
and the Langyue Studio

351
19:55.920 --> 19:56.960
are not far apart,

352
19:57.200 --> 19:59.240
separated only by Tinghe Pond.

353
20:06.000 --> 20:06.960
If the body

354
20:07.110 --> 20:09.240
was really transferred through the air,

355
20:09.240 --> 20:11.790
it must've crossed Tinghe Pond.

356
20:14.790 --> 20:16.590
I found a few traces of blood

357
20:16.590 --> 20:18.400
on the lotus leaves there.

358
20:18.640 --> 20:21.240
That is enough to support my inference.

359
20:21.720 --> 20:23.000
As for

360
20:23.110 --> 20:25.170
the other bloodstains on the ground,

361
20:25.240 --> 20:27.000
given the fierce battle that night,

362
20:27.000 --> 20:28.640
we naturally assumed

363
20:28.640 --> 20:30.240
they were left by wounded soldiers,

364
20:30.240 --> 20:31.000
so

365
20:31.920 --> 20:33.720
they didn't draw our attention.

366
20:33.790 --> 20:34.510
But how exactly

367
20:34.510 --> 20:35.590
did they

368
20:35.590 --> 20:36.790
move the body?

369
20:37.440 --> 20:39.030
There is a stealth weapon in the jianghu

370
20:39.030 --> 20:40.510
called "Back and Forth."

371
20:40.550 --> 20:42.440
This weapon is made of iron wire

372
20:42.830 --> 20:44.760
that can be extended and reeled in.

373
20:55.720 --> 20:57.110
If everything you've said is correct,

374
20:57.110 --> 20:59.440
the murderer must've been inside the Tongtian Pavilion.

375
20:59.440 --> 21:00.720
To successfully

376
21:00.830 --> 21:02.400
move Sui Bing's body

377
21:02.400 --> 21:03.590
under heavy guard,

378
21:03.920 --> 21:05.640
the murderer would've needed someone

379
21:05.640 --> 21:06.840
to create a diversion

380
21:06.920 --> 21:09.310
to draw away the soldiers on duty that night.

381
21:09.310 --> 21:11.240
But how could the murderer have known

382
21:11.240 --> 21:12.440
that the Liluo people

383
21:12.830 --> 21:13.590
would drive the shadow puppets

384
21:13.590 --> 21:15.200
to cause trouble that night?

385
21:16.480 --> 21:18.210
There's only one possibility.

386
21:19.350 --> 21:20.590
The murderer is from Liluo.

387
21:20.590 --> 21:21.350
Also,

388
21:21.830 --> 21:23.400
the method used to kill Sui Bing

389
21:23.400 --> 21:25.110
was clearly intended to imitate

390
21:25.110 --> 21:26.550
the deaths of the previous 9 victims.

391
21:26.550 --> 21:28.550
However, Zhenzhu's autopsy results

392
21:28.550 --> 21:29.830
have never been made public.

393
21:29.830 --> 21:31.000
So how did the murderer

394
21:31.000 --> 21:32.790
know details

395
21:33.110 --> 21:35.110
such as the bloody puncture wound in the neck?

396
21:35.110 --> 21:36.570
The one who killed Sui Bing

397
21:36.590 --> 21:38.160
and the killer of the 9 victims

398
21:38.160 --> 21:39.240
are one and the same—

399
21:39.240 --> 21:40.900
and that person is from Liluo.

400
21:40.960 --> 21:41.750
Oh no,

401
21:42.510 --> 21:44.570
the Grand Heir Apparent is in danger.

402
21:44.790 --> 21:45.590
Meng Rui,

403
21:45.920 --> 21:47.750
go to the Langyue Studio to verify our theory immediately.

404
21:47.750 --> 21:48.790
I'll go find Prince Ping

405
21:48.790 --> 21:49.640
and Lord Huo.

406
21:49.640 --> 21:50.310
Okay.

407
21:53.170 --> 21:56.070
[Langyue Studio]

408
22:18.350 --> 22:26.590
[Prosperous Times and Favourable Fortune]

409
22:19.350 --> 22:20.400
Lord Huo,

410
22:20.880 --> 22:22.960
Prince Ping and Divine Constable Qingyang

411
22:22.960 --> 22:24.960
have cleared everyone

412
22:25.030 --> 22:26.690
out of the Tongtian Pavilion.

413
22:26.960 --> 22:28.620
The guards are posted outside

414
22:28.680 --> 22:30.340
and will keep watch all night.

415
22:30.750 --> 22:31.550
Good.

416
22:33.000 --> 22:34.720
Make sure security is airtight.

417
22:34.720 --> 22:35.510
Yes, sir.

418
22:35.640 --> 22:37.110
Apart from myself,

419
22:37.200 --> 22:39.200
no one is permitted to come into contact

420
22:39.200 --> 22:41.600
with His Highness the Grand Heir Apparent.

421
22:41.830 --> 22:42.640
Understood.

422
22:53.440 --> 22:54.350
This way,

423
22:55.350 --> 22:57.510
it should be foolproof.

424
22:58.490 --> 23:01.630
[Gutan County Government]

425
23:10.350 --> 23:11.550
You're finally back.

426
23:12.070 --> 23:13.480
We were worried about you.

427
23:13.480 --> 23:14.880
We've made a new discovery

428
23:14.880 --> 23:16.480
regarding Sui Bing's death.

429
23:17.590 --> 23:19.110
We've found a new clue too.

430
23:29.880 --> 23:31.150
Murder!

431
23:31.350 --> 23:32.490
Murder!

432
23:33.400 --> 23:34.360
Murder!

433
23:53.550 --> 23:54.770
Why does

434
23:55.070 --> 23:56.790
this little puppet look so familiar?

435
23:56.790 --> 23:59.030
It's the Cowherd from "The Magpie Bridge Reunion."

436
23:59.030 --> 23:59.830
Right.

437
24:00.640 --> 24:03.000
Shopkeeper Huang performed that play the other day.

438
24:03.000 --> 24:04.260
Could it belong to him?

439
24:07.200 --> 24:08.200
This isn't the one

440
24:08.200 --> 24:09.460
Shopkeeper Huang has.

441
24:10.240 --> 24:11.800
This one is finer

442
24:11.880 --> 24:13.510
and better crafted.

443
24:13.680 --> 24:15.480
It's clearly no ordinary piece.

444
24:18.400 --> 24:19.200
This is it.

445
24:20.240 --> 24:21.970
We've found the murder weapon.

446
24:22.640 --> 24:23.590
This matches

447
24:24.030 --> 24:25.480
the wounds on Du Zhongtao's body

448
24:25.480 --> 24:26.510
exactly.

449
24:27.480 --> 24:28.200
To find the murder weapon

450
24:28.200 --> 24:29.400
used in the 9-victim murder case,

451
24:29.400 --> 24:30.200
Yan and I

452
24:30.200 --> 24:31.600
collected every suspicious tool

453
24:31.600 --> 24:33.480
we could find on the market in Gutan.

454
24:33.480 --> 24:34.720
This was among them:

455
24:35.120 --> 24:37.580
a carving knife used to make shadow puppets.

456
24:37.960 --> 24:38.790
Du Zhongtao

457
24:38.830 --> 24:40.240
was stabbed 81 times with it.

458
24:40.240 --> 24:41.550
Eighty-one times?

459
24:42.590 --> 24:43.720
As the saying goes,

460
24:43.960 --> 24:45.550
"Slicing flesh with a small knife—

461
24:45.550 --> 24:46.750
and if the wounds don't kill him,

462
24:46.750 --> 24:48.110
the pain will."

463
24:48.790 --> 24:50.880
It seems that this time it was

464
24:50.880 --> 24:53.000
the real shadow puppet ghost who did it.

465
24:53.000 --> 24:54.110
You mean

466
24:54.110 --> 24:54.920
Yin Jie?

467
24:55.680 --> 24:56.510
Yin Jie?

468
24:58.400 --> 24:59.660
Is Yin Jie still alive?

469
25:01.000 --> 25:02.800
According to official records,

470
25:03.070 --> 25:04.680
Yin Jie fell off a cliff and died

471
25:04.680 --> 25:05.940
while fleeing arrest.

472
25:06.160 --> 25:08.070
The man who led the pursuit back then

473
25:08.070 --> 25:09.670
was this very Magistrate Du.

474
25:10.830 --> 25:12.200
As the local magistrate,

475
25:12.200 --> 25:13.580
he failed to deliver justice for the wronged man

476
25:13.580 --> 25:14.550
and instead

477
25:14.590 --> 25:17.000
had him arrested as a criminal.

478
25:17.590 --> 25:19.400
It's understandable that Yin Jie would

479
25:19.400 --> 25:21.800
seek revenge for his personal grievances.

480
25:33.510 --> 25:34.400
What's this?

481
25:34.880 --> 25:35.680
What is it?

482
25:37.400 --> 25:38.930
The Dragon Saliva Crystal.

483
25:39.110 --> 25:40.000
Dragon Saliva?

484
25:42.310 --> 25:43.550
Is this thing real?

485
25:43.720 --> 25:45.520
Most people never get to see one.

486
25:45.640 --> 25:47.620
Where did Du Zhongtao get it?

487
25:49.480 --> 25:50.880
How do you know about this?

488
25:50.880 --> 25:52.280
You've seen this before?

489
25:53.270 --> 25:54.110
Just a guess.

490
25:54.110 --> 25:55.000
Let me see it.

491
25:56.240 --> 25:58.570
Is this something anyone can just look at?

492
26:12.580 --> 26:13.620
If this really is

493
26:13.650 --> 26:15.180
the Dragon Saliva Crystal,

494
26:15.400 --> 26:16.160
then Du Zhongtao

495
26:16.160 --> 26:17.440
must've lied about

496
26:17.440 --> 26:18.500
at least one thing.

497
26:18.610 --> 26:20.880
[Langyue Studio]

498
26:19.510 --> 26:21.310
When he came to deliver the wine,

499
26:21.680 --> 26:22.510
he

500
26:22.510 --> 26:23.350
found

501
26:23.350 --> 26:24.680
the crystal that had fallen

502
26:24.680 --> 26:26.240
from Sui Bing's body.

503
26:26.790 --> 26:28.240
That's the real reason

504
26:28.400 --> 26:30.070
he chose not to

505
26:30.310 --> 26:31.880
report the body

506
26:31.880 --> 26:32.880
after finding it.

507
26:33.070 --> 26:34.240
But if the killer

508
26:34.240 --> 26:36.240
discovered that Sui Bing had stolen the crystal,

509
26:36.240 --> 26:37.720
why didn't he search the body

510
26:37.720 --> 26:39.030
after killing him

511
26:39.400 --> 26:42.240
instead of leaving the crystal on it?

512
26:43.590 --> 26:44.450
Good question.

513
26:46.920 --> 26:47.880
Think about it.

514
26:48.310 --> 26:49.830
After Sui Bing was killed,

515
26:50.110 --> 26:51.770
the killer didn't search him.

516
26:51.880 --> 26:53.810
But when Du Zhongtao was murdered,

517
26:53.880 --> 26:56.480
the crystal was left in his mouth.

518
26:57.030 --> 26:59.430
It seems the killer did this deliberately.

519
26:59.640 --> 27:00.740
As if

520
27:01.200 --> 27:02.960
he wanted us to know something.

521
27:11.880 --> 27:13.680
As events have unfolded—

522
27:14.030 --> 27:15.400
the 9-victim murder case,

523
27:15.400 --> 27:17.260
the shadow puppets running amok,

524
27:17.510 --> 27:18.680
Sui Bing's death,

525
27:18.680 --> 27:20.110
and Du Zhongtao's murder—

526
27:20.110 --> 27:22.270
every clue and lead

527
27:22.510 --> 27:24.840
seems to point to the shadow puppet ghost.

528
27:24.880 --> 27:26.040
But if

529
27:26.240 --> 27:27.240
all of this

530
27:27.270 --> 27:29.530
is a smokescreen orchestrated by Liluo,

531
27:29.640 --> 27:30.640
then

532
27:31.880 --> 27:32.730
they must be

533
27:32.760 --> 27:34.690
trying hard to cover up some truth.

534
27:35.000 --> 27:36.610
So you're saying

535
27:36.920 --> 27:39.070
we've been barking up the wrong tree all along?

536
27:39.070 --> 27:40.680
The situation's already so critical.

537
27:40.680 --> 27:41.480
Li Si,

538
27:41.640 --> 27:42.840
what should we do now?

539
27:43.880 --> 27:44.640
Perhaps

540
27:45.440 --> 27:47.570
we should go back to the very beginning

541
27:47.880 --> 27:49.270
of this whole case.

542
27:55.850 --> 27:59.520
[Changlai Steamed Bun Shop]

543
27:56.480 --> 27:57.200
Jiuying,

544
27:57.200 --> 27:58.880
you go keep watch at the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

545
27:58.880 --> 27:59.590
Okay.

546
28:02.480 --> 28:04.280
Dear customers, please come in.

547
28:09.240 --> 28:10.830
Please have a seat, everyone.

548
28:10.830 --> 28:11.680
Enjoy some hot soup

549
28:11.680 --> 28:12.480
to warm up.

550
28:12.480 --> 28:13.350
Waiter,

551
28:13.790 --> 28:15.070
how's business been

552
28:15.400 --> 28:16.480
lately?

553
28:17.440 --> 28:18.680
So-so, I suppose.

554
28:18.830 --> 28:20.030
We hope you'll

555
28:20.070 --> 28:21.040
come back and patronize

556
28:21.040 --> 28:22.570
our little shop more often.

557
28:23.240 --> 28:24.960
What would you like to eat?

558
28:25.830 --> 28:26.880
On the 6th of this month,

559
28:26.880 --> 28:27.910
4 diners

560
28:27.940 --> 28:29.240
died in your shop.

561
28:29.310 --> 28:30.440
Whatever they ordered,

562
28:30.440 --> 28:31.440
bring us the same.

563
28:31.830 --> 28:32.730
Well...

564
28:33.100 --> 28:34.550
[Divine Constable Tally]

565
28:33.510 --> 28:34.640
The Divine Constable Bureau is on a case.

566
28:34.640 --> 28:35.880
Just do as you're told.

567
28:35.880 --> 28:36.920
And call your boss

568
28:36.940 --> 28:37.740
over here too.

569
28:38.680 --> 28:39.480
Yes.

570
28:39.790 --> 28:40.590
Boss.

571
28:41.270 --> 28:42.070
Boss!

572
28:46.640 --> 28:48.170
Nothing in this shop

573
28:48.400 --> 28:49.750
looks suspicious.

574
28:55.750 --> 28:56.550
Shopkeeper!

575
28:56.550 --> 28:58.240
-Shopkeeper! -The wind's picking up.

576
28:58.240 --> 28:59.640
It's freezing in here!

577
28:59.920 --> 29:00.720
Why open the windows

578
29:00.720 --> 29:01.700
on such a cold day?

579
29:01.700 --> 29:02.890
Sorry, sorry!

580
29:02.920 --> 29:04.400
Quick, close the windows!

581
29:04.480 --> 29:05.240
Close them all!

582
29:05.240 --> 29:05.920
Close them all.

583
29:05.920 --> 29:06.880
Sorry.

584
29:07.000 --> 29:08.060
It's just too cold.

585
29:15.030 --> 29:16.230
Sorry, everyone.

586
29:17.440 --> 29:19.480
Freshly steamed buns!

587
29:22.030 --> 29:23.200
So delicious.

588
29:26.110 --> 29:27.590
Officers,

589
29:27.590 --> 29:28.790
what can I do for you?

590
29:29.270 --> 29:31.600
Is there anything wrong with our service?

591
29:33.640 --> 29:35.440
If there's anything you need...

592
30:03.310 --> 30:04.260
What's going on?

593
30:14.110 --> 30:14.920
Yan!

594
30:15.640 --> 30:16.440
Yan!

595
30:16.440 --> 30:17.240
Yan!

596
30:20.660 --> 30:21.510
-Yan. -Hurry.

597
30:21.510 --> 30:22.840
-Yan, come on. -Come on.

598
30:27.200 --> 30:28.000
How is he?

599
30:34.510 --> 30:35.570
It's Chiying bugs.

600
30:44.680 --> 30:45.580
Yan!

601
30:45.610 --> 30:46.810
Quick, hold him down!

602
31:19.960 --> 31:20.820
How do you feel?

603
31:21.480 --> 31:22.540
-Come on. -Come on.

604
31:26.030 --> 31:26.830
Yan.

605
31:42.440 --> 31:43.570
What happened to me?

606
31:45.310 --> 31:46.720
If it weren't for Zhenzhu,

607
31:46.720 --> 31:47.880
you would've died.

608
31:55.480 --> 31:56.480
They're all dead.

609
31:57.110 --> 31:58.750
So this was the cause of death.

610
31:58.750 --> 32:00.310
No wonder there was no murder weapon.

611
32:00.310 --> 32:02.770
No wonder all 9 victims died at the same time.

612
32:02.880 --> 32:04.240
But when did the Chiying bugs

613
32:04.240 --> 32:05.030
get inside

614
32:05.050 --> 32:06.270
their bodies?

615
32:09.440 --> 32:10.240
Yan,

616
32:10.640 --> 32:11.400
were you

617
32:11.400 --> 32:12.680
bitten by a Chiying bug before?

618
32:12.680 --> 32:13.480
Or

619
32:14.110 --> 32:15.480
did you eat anything

620
32:15.830 --> 32:17.290
that the rest of us didn't?

621
32:18.310 --> 32:19.240
No.

622
32:23.110 --> 32:24.640
The Dragon Pond holy water.

623
32:25.640 --> 32:28.970
The holy water of the Golden Dragon Pavilion's Dragon Pond!

624
32:44.720 --> 32:45.510
Come on.

625
32:58.870 --> 32:59.990
These two are fine.

626
33:00.310 --> 33:01.680
Have either of you ever drunk

627
33:01.680 --> 33:03.640
the Dragon Pond holy water from the Golden Dragon Pavilion?

628
33:03.640 --> 33:05.500
Neither of us is from around here.

629
33:05.550 --> 33:08.030
We were only hired 2 days ago.

630
33:08.030 --> 33:10.960
We've never even been to the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

631
33:12.550 --> 33:13.400
It's Liluo.

632
33:13.920 --> 33:14.970
Liluo must have

633
33:15.160 --> 33:16.820
tampered with the pond water.

634
33:16.920 --> 33:18.180
The previous 9 victims

635
33:19.070 --> 33:20.400
must have drunk it too.

636
33:23.680 --> 33:25.510
The Golden Dragon Pavilion is always packed with worshippers.

637
33:25.510 --> 33:27.510
Countless people go there every day

638
33:27.510 --> 33:28.770
to take the holy water.

639
33:29.160 --> 33:30.070
I wonder if the Grand Heir Apparent

640
33:30.070 --> 33:31.110
has drunk any.

641
33:45.750 --> 33:47.270
Quick, let's go back.

642
33:48.720 --> 33:50.830
It's the bells from the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

643
33:50.830 --> 33:52.510
The rite of beseeching heaven is over.

644
33:52.510 --> 33:54.770
The blessing ceremony is about to begin.

645
33:55.030 --> 33:57.230
It's time for the truth to come to light.

646
33:58.310 --> 33:59.110
Everyone,

647
33:59.920 --> 34:00.720
let's go.

648
34:14.889 --> 34:18.219
[Golden Dragon Hall]

649
34:35.210 --> 34:37.060
[A Tranquil Mind Perceives the Mysteries]

650
34:36.510 --> 34:38.070
May the gods bless us

651
34:38.380 --> 34:40.219
and keep Ye safe.

652
34:40.840 --> 34:42.480
May the gods bless us

653
34:43.480 --> 34:45.190
and keep Ye safe.

654
35:06.940 --> 35:08.570
[Golden Dragon Pavilion]

655
35:11.800 --> 35:12.800
Get out of the way!

656
35:14.880 --> 35:16.320
Liluo is plotting something.

657
35:16.320 --> 35:17.840
The blessing ceremony must not proceed!

658
35:17.840 --> 35:19.110
Anyone who disrupts the ceremony

659
35:19.110 --> 35:20.070
shall be executed on the spot!

660
35:20.070 --> 35:21.280
The pond water has been poisoned!

661
35:21.280 --> 35:22.480
The Grand Heir Apparent is in danger!

662
35:22.480 --> 35:23.410
Back off!

663
35:23.430 --> 35:24.570
Back off!

664
35:24.590 --> 35:25.840
Back off!

665
35:32.110 --> 35:33.880
Where is the Grand Heir Apparent?

666
35:33.880 --> 35:34.920
In the Golden Dragon Hall,

667
35:34.920 --> 35:36.380
at the blessing ceremony.

668
35:46.440 --> 35:47.320
Meng Rui, Yan,

669
35:47.760 --> 35:49.020
stay here and make sure

670
35:49.710 --> 35:51.510
no one drinks the holy water again.

671
35:51.510 --> 35:53.670
Zhenzhu, come with me.

672
35:53.690 --> 35:54.460
Okay.

673
35:54.710 --> 35:55.960
We'll hold our ground here.

674
35:55.960 --> 35:57.670
If we have to, we'll break in.

675
35:57.840 --> 35:58.630
Be careful.

676
35:58.840 --> 35:59.630
Okay.

677
36:00.320 --> 36:01.110
Let's go.

678
36:46.590 --> 36:47.400
Zhenzhu.

679
36:51.670 --> 36:53.480
Found beneath the prayer cushion.

680
36:53.480 --> 36:55.280
Another Dragon Saliva Crystal.

681
36:55.710 --> 36:57.440
But why would it appear

682
36:57.480 --> 36:59.960
under the cushion where the Grand Heir Apparent knelt?

683
36:59.960 --> 37:01.670
What exactly is

684
37:02.320 --> 37:04.520
this so-called Dragon Saliva Crystal?

685
37:16.360 --> 37:17.160
What's wrong?

686
37:17.320 --> 37:19.480
I didn't notice it earlier at the county office,

687
37:19.480 --> 37:20.320
but this

688
37:20.550 --> 37:21.750
smells like a corpse.

689
37:21.780 --> 37:22.980
The smell of a corpse?

690
37:23.710 --> 37:24.670
Are you sure?

691
37:24.840 --> 37:25.970
I can't be mistaken.

692
37:26.320 --> 37:28.320
I know the smell better than anyone.

693
37:37.880 --> 37:39.740
It really is the smell of a corpse.

694
37:47.590 --> 37:48.400
Li Si.

695
37:52.150 --> 37:53.670
Yesterday, Yan found blue moss

696
37:53.670 --> 37:55.110
on the sole of Sui Bing's boot.

697
37:55.110 --> 37:56.970
This is the reply from the Bureau.

698
37:59.110 --> 38:00.970
"The 'Notes on Rare Plants' state

699
38:01.320 --> 38:02.760
that among mosses there is a rare variety

700
38:02.760 --> 38:03.670
called Ice Soul Moss,

701
38:03.670 --> 38:04.840
which resembles frost

702
38:04.840 --> 38:06.500
and has an intense blue color.

703
38:06.630 --> 38:07.920
There's also an insect

704
38:08.110 --> 38:09.280
called the Frost Moth,

705
38:09.280 --> 38:11.760
which feeds exclusively on this moss throughout its life

706
38:11.760 --> 38:13.480
and is even rarer worldwide."

707
38:18.550 --> 38:21.710
The scales found on the Grand Heir Apparent's chopsticks...

708
38:21.710 --> 38:22.520
If Frost Moths

709
38:22.540 --> 38:24.230
are raised inside the abdomen of a corpse,

710
38:24.230 --> 38:25.290
the corpse can go

711
38:25.310 --> 38:27.000
without decaying for years,

712
38:27.030 --> 38:29.030
appearing exactly as it did in life.

713
38:31.310 --> 38:32.590
Frost Moth scales

714
38:32.710 --> 38:33.820
turned up, of all places,

715
38:33.820 --> 38:36.480
on the chopsticks the Grand Heir Apparent used.

716
38:37.710 --> 38:38.890
This was

717
38:38.910 --> 38:40.330
never a Dragon Saliva Crystal.

718
38:40.330 --> 38:42.080
It's corpse fluid,

719
38:42.280 --> 38:44.320
crystallized by the Frost Moths.

720
38:46.230 --> 38:48.630
Could it be that the Grand Heir Apparent...

721
38:49.670 --> 38:50.880
is already dead?

722
38:53.820 --> 38:55.990
[Yunding Pavilion]

723
38:56.510 --> 38:58.920
You two truly have sharp eyes, Divine Constables.

724
38:58.920 --> 39:00.680
You've uncovered

725
39:00.700 --> 39:02.340
the mystery after all.

726
39:03.150 --> 39:04.510
Master Yun Hai?

727
39:05.280 --> 39:07.610
Master, you knew from the very beginning?

728
39:12.400 --> 39:13.460
Could it be that...

729
39:14.630 --> 39:16.130
you are the Liluo spy

730
39:16.150 --> 39:17.360
hiding inside

731
39:17.840 --> 39:19.070
the pavilion?

732
39:19.840 --> 39:21.190
I am indeed.

733
39:25.480 --> 39:27.280
Zhenzhu, you go first.

734
39:27.710 --> 39:28.800
Leave this to me.

735
39:29.030 --> 39:29.840
Okay.

736
39:30.000 --> 39:30.800
Be careful.

737
39:50.840 --> 39:52.540
You killed

738
39:52.920 --> 39:54.760
Sui Bing and Du Zhongtao, didn't you?

739
39:54.760 --> 39:56.510
Then why don't you suspect

740
39:56.600 --> 39:58.730
that I killed the Grand Heir Apparent?

741
39:58.760 --> 40:00.630
Huo Daozhang has stayed

742
40:00.920 --> 40:03.180
by the Grand Heir Apparent day and night.

743
40:05.070 --> 40:07.070
If anything had happened to Zhou Ye,

744
40:07.150 --> 40:08.480
wouldn't he have known?

745
40:09.110 --> 40:10.710
There is only one explanation.

746
40:10.710 --> 40:13.110
The Grand Heir Apparent was already dead

747
40:13.550 --> 40:15.320
before he came to the Golden Dragon Pavilion.

748
40:15.320 --> 40:17.700
Huo Daozhang knew perfectly well

749
40:17.960 --> 40:19.140
that he was escorting

750
40:19.140 --> 40:20.480
a corpse.

751
40:20.510 --> 40:22.230
And the one who ordered this

752
40:23.070 --> 40:25.200
could only have been the Crown Prince.

753
40:25.760 --> 40:26.550
But

754
40:27.360 --> 40:29.290
why would the Crown Prince do this?

755
40:29.360 --> 40:30.840
Why don't you tell me first

756
40:31.280 --> 40:32.810
how Sui Bing and Du Zhongtao

757
40:32.920 --> 40:34.230
were killed

758
40:34.480 --> 40:36.480
and why?

759
40:50.030 --> 40:51.960
Sui Bing was killed because he went

760
40:51.960 --> 40:54.280
looking for the crystal on a sudden impulse.

761
40:54.280 --> 40:56.670
Du Zhongtao was killed because he found the crystal.

762
40:56.670 --> 40:58.200
That, too, wasn't planned.

763
40:58.710 --> 41:00.030
Neither death

764
41:00.270 --> 41:01.320
was part of

765
41:01.710 --> 41:03.320
the original plan.

766
41:04.630 --> 41:06.060
At first, I thought

767
41:06.320 --> 41:07.600
Sui Bing was killed

768
41:07.710 --> 41:09.640
because he had stolen the crystal.

769
41:09.670 --> 41:11.000
But now it seems

770
41:11.230 --> 41:12.030
he

771
41:12.480 --> 41:14.640
must have witnessed something

772
41:15.710 --> 41:17.760
he was never supposed to see that night.

773
41:17.760 --> 41:18.590
That's why

774
41:18.960 --> 41:20.710
he was silenced.

775
41:21.520 --> 41:22.650
[Yunding Pavilion]

776
42:07.800 --> 42:08.660
Your Highness?

777
42:11.300 --> 42:12.160
Your Highness?

778
42:24.360 --> 42:25.880
The... The...

779
42:26.510 --> 42:27.970
The Grand Heir Apparent is dead.

780
42:27.970 --> 42:28.970
Your Highness...

781
42:29.510 --> 42:30.880
I have nothing to do with it.

782
42:30.880 --> 42:32.880
I swear, I have nothing to do with it.

783
42:36.070 --> 42:36.920
That's...

784
42:46.480 --> 42:49.400
The... The Dragon Saliva Crystal?

785
42:53.630 --> 42:54.570
It really is...

786
42:54.710 --> 42:57.240
It really is hidden in the Golden Dragon Hall.

787
43:07.920 --> 43:08.710
What...

788
43:12.480 --> 43:13.410
Well... Well...

789
43:13.710 --> 43:14.510
Master.

790
43:14.710 --> 43:15.630
Lord Huo,

791
43:16.440 --> 43:18.100
you've been rather careless.

792
43:18.280 --> 43:19.710
Thank you for your help, Master.

793
43:19.710 --> 43:21.840
I've been following the Crown Prince,

794
43:22.360 --> 43:25.070
so I must do all I can for him.

795
43:31.880 --> 43:32.710
This

796
43:33.510 --> 43:35.390
is the weapon you used

797
43:35.420 --> 43:37.040
to kill Sui Bing.

798
43:38.230 --> 43:39.470
After that,

799
43:39.550 --> 43:41.670
you cut out Sui Bing's heart and liver,

800
43:41.670 --> 43:43.630
and took advantage of the lunar eclipse

801
43:43.630 --> 43:45.070
and Liluo's attack

802
43:45.070 --> 43:46.110
to send the body

803
43:46.320 --> 43:48.530
through the air to the Langyue Studio.

804
43:50.210 --> 43:51.850
[Yunding Pavilion]

805
43:53.320 --> 43:54.720
You made it look as though

806
43:54.840 --> 43:57.300
he'd been killed by the shadow puppet ghost.

807
43:58.440 --> 43:59.920
Huo Daozhang must've detected

808
43:59.920 --> 44:00.920
the stench of a corpse

809
44:00.920 --> 44:03.190
-Du Zhongtao! -coming from Du Zhongtao.

810
44:03.480 --> 44:04.440
He figured out

811
44:04.630 --> 44:05.800
that the crystal

812
44:05.830 --> 44:07.240
stolen by Sui Bing

813
44:07.360 --> 44:09.190
had already fallen into Du's hands.

814
44:09.190 --> 44:10.000
So,

815
44:10.150 --> 44:13.670
he sent you to eliminate the loose ends.

816
44:14.590 --> 44:15.400
Master,

817
44:16.670 --> 44:18.800
although you killed Du Zhongtao,

818
44:19.070 --> 44:20.490
you deliberately left the crystal

819
44:20.490 --> 44:22.070
inside his mouth.

820
44:22.550 --> 44:23.550
You did that

821
44:23.920 --> 44:25.880
so we would discover

822
44:26.320 --> 44:28.520
the truth that Zhou Ye was already dead.

823
44:29.320 --> 44:30.480
Am I right?

824
44:36.480 --> 44:37.710
Master Yun Hai,

825
44:37.920 --> 44:40.320
as the abbot of the Golden Dragon Pavilion,

826
44:40.360 --> 44:42.150
you feigned loyalty to the Crown Prince

827
44:42.150 --> 44:43.050
while secretly

828
44:43.280 --> 44:45.280
colluding with Liluo's Dark Night.

829
44:45.550 --> 44:47.570
What exactly are you after?

830
44:59.000 --> 44:59.800
Move!

831
45:00.110 --> 45:01.480
-I said, move! -Stop!

832
45:04.320 --> 45:05.070
Ms. Bai,

833
45:06.070 --> 45:07.190
why are you forcing your way into the main hall?

834
45:07.190 --> 45:08.050
Your Highness,

835
45:09.510 --> 45:11.170
the Grand Heir Apparent is...

836
45:12.960 --> 45:15.240
The Grand Heir Apparent is already dead.

837
45:27.550 --> 45:29.710
You truly live up to your reputation.

838
45:31.320 --> 45:34.710
But isn't it a bit too late

839
45:35.630 --> 45:36.600
to know

840
45:37.480 --> 45:39.000
the whole story now?

841
46:05.110 --> 46:06.040
What's going on?

842
46:06.510 --> 46:07.440
What happened?

843
46:13.030 --> 46:14.070
What did you do?

844
46:24.670 --> 46:25.600
What's going on?

845
46:28.020 --> 46:28.830
Oh no.

846
46:29.070 --> 46:29.920
Jiuying,

847
46:30.320 --> 46:31.070
stay here and keep watch.

848
46:31.070 --> 46:31.840
Meng Rui.

849
46:33.670 --> 46:34.760
Look! What's happening?

850
46:34.760 --> 46:35.570
What's going on over there?

851
46:35.570 --> 46:36.550
Make way!

852
46:38.480 --> 46:39.320
Ye.

853
46:49.870 --> 46:50.890
The Dragon King has manifested!

854
46:50.890 --> 46:52.490
The Golden Dragon King has manifested!
